<title>TAIWAN: Taiwan to issue T$5 bln NCDs on Monday.</title>
<headline>Taiwan to issue T$5 bln NCDs on Monday.</headline>
<dateline>TAIPEI 1996-12-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Taiwan's central bank will issue T$5 billion in 53-day negotiable certificates of deposit (NCDs) on Monday, a central bank official said.</p>
<p>Bids would close at local time 2 p.m. (0700 GMT), the official added.</p>
<p>-- Taipei Newsroom (2-5080815)</p>
</text>
